WEBVTT

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:30.625
kuwa kuzingatia ulimwengu ni moja ya utu wetu

00:06:30.649 --> 00:06:33.661
labda naweza fanya mazoezi ya sarekasi tena.

00:06:33.685 --> 00:06:36.919
Au sivyo, Abuelita ?

00:06:38.008 --> 00:06:40.619
Tunaweza fanya hili.

00:06:40.942 --> 00:06:42.441
Yote najaribu kufanya na kazi yangu

00:06:42.966 --> 00:06:44.116
ni kuwapa watu wengine mtazamo chanya wa matumaini.

00:06:44.569 --> 00:06:46.157
Lakini ni ngumu kidogo.

00:06:46.181 --> 00:06:49.189
Kuna tamaa,

00:06:49.879 --> 00:06:51.425
kuna kiburi,

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.047
kuna pesa,

00:06:53.071 --> 00:06:54.490
na pia uyakinifu.

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:55.766
Hulka ya watu hurahisisha kuongelea haya mambo,

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.291
lakini napata wakati mgumu kuwafunza.

00:06:57.315 --> 00:07:00.478
Nataka wajiamini kwa kujitahidi kila wakati.